Use labels and help in the selected language.
Display h028 on request at confirmation.
Use l004 for the Callsign? prompt.
The edit field echoes input and supports editing, up to 10 characters.
After Enter, display l006 followed by the user's entry, then l007 Continue Y/N?.
Y confirms, saves call=<user input> in yac.ini, clears the screen and returns to yac.py.
N returns to editing and preserves the entered text.
At confirmation, H reads the same help and returns to Continue Y/N?.
Space and E no longer confirm or edit the name.
